Generally you can only write scrolls that you have identified.
There is a small probability that you can write a scroll that you 
have not identified yet. The probability is higher for a wizard. 
Someone once posted explicit info on this from the source code --
I'll see if I still have it.

Other nifty scrolls: enchant armor, enchant weapon, (blessed) remove curse,
(cursed) teleport, taming (if you like pets), (blessed) scare 
monster (for low-level chars)....etc....

